---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { support } from '../support';
---

<Base
    title="Support"
    description="Traceway is free, and it always will be. Donations pay for the server, the routing engine, and the map."
>
    <main class="wrap page">
        <p class="kicker">Support</p>
        <h1>Free today. Free for good.</h1>
        <div class="prose">
            <p>
                Traceway is free, and it always will be. No ads, no tracking, no
                paid tier, and no feature held back behind a subscription.
            </p>
            <p>
                I built it because I love being out there, on the bike, on the
                trail, on a long run, and I wanted the best route planner I could
                get without paying the high monthly prices the big apps ask for.
                So I made one, and I made it for everyone.
            </p>
            <p>
                Drawing a loop still costs money. A server runs the planner, a
                routing engine scores every road and path, and the map data from
                OpenStreetMap has to live somewhere close to it. I pay for all
                of it, in spare time.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you enjoy Traceway, a donation helps keep it online. It is
                never required. Nothing unlocks, and the planner stays the same
                for everyone.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-cta">
            <a class="fill" href={support.paypal} rel="noopener">
                Donate with PayPal
            </a>
            <a class="ghost" href={support.github} rel="noopener">
                Sponsor on GitHub
            </a>
            <small>
                Or send any amount to <a href={support.paypalMe} rel="noopener"
                    >paypal.me/noahgillard1</a
                >.
            </small>
        </div>
    </main>
</Base>
